1
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:02,398
(Lucy:)Why were you acting so strange tonight?

2
00:00:03,731 --> 00:00:05,701
You called me "feminine."

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,530
(Raj:)I wanted you to think I was more manly.

4
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:11,396
(Lucy:)Raj, I didn't say feminine was a bad thing.

5
00:00:11,606 --> 00:00:15,266
I meant you're sweet and thoughtful
and your skin looks so much like caramel...

6
00:00:15,476 --> 00:00:18,236
(Lucy:)...I just want to dip an apple in your face.

7
00:00:19,314 --> 00:00:22,684
(Raj:)I do have a pretty balls-to-the-wall
moisturizing regimen.

8
00:00:23,718 --> 00:00:25,708
(Lucy:)So are you okay?

9
00:00:26,587 --> 00:00:27,957
(Sheldon(on phone):)- Yeah.
- Good.

10
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:32,180
(Lucy:)- Do you even like hockey?
- Heh. No.

11
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:35,800
I bought this at the Staples Center
when I went to see Taylor Swift.

12
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:43,833
(Penny:)So I was thinking how excited you get
about stuff like Buffy or science...

13
00:00:44,072 --> 00:00:46,732
(Penny:)...or which TV remote
you and Sheldon should buy...

14
00:00:46,941 --> 00:00:49,471
(Leonard:)The Harmony One was fine.
We didn't need the 1100...

15
00:00:49,711 --> 00:00:52,301
(Leonard:)...which he knows is too big for my hand.

16
00:00:54,015 --> 00:00:56,605
(Penny:)See, that's the kind of passion
I didn't think I had.

17
00:00:56,818 --> 00:01:00,018
(Penny:)But then I realized
I'm passionate about you.

